{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Heads up: This game has no &quot;Chosen One&quot;. Just some poor soul stuck in a glitchy underworld. And yep, that's you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.poster.avif?t=1763022051\" width=1028 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.webm?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.mp4?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Where am I? Who am I? What should I do?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are you?</strong> - The ultimate riddle you need to solve in this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where am I?</strong> - A digital hellscape where hundreds of unhinged characters are trapped in eternal life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do?</strong> - Loot every scrap, beat up every NPC. Find the truth of this world before the Admin deletes you\u2014or <strong>become</strong> the truth yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.poster.avif?t=1763022051\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.webm?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.mp4?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How to Play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mad World:</strong> Explore hundreds of stitched-together maps and enjoy the schizophrenia brought by the landscapes. Epic? You bet! Even the broccoli is contemplating existentialism here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear-Simulator:</strong> Resources don't respawn. Your ultimate goal is to empty the world\u2014including yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Story:</strong> No main quest, only pieces scattered everywhere. Every NPC can be killed or recruited. Your choices don't matter anyway; they all lead to nothingness in the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Builds:</strong> Forget flashy loot. Here, <strong>Gear is Everything</strong>. One piece = Skill + Passive + Stats. Can't decide? Problem solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overloaded Senses:</strong> We hate repetition. Every battle, every inch of land, every BGM is unique. We guarantee every minute will drive you delightfully insane.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.poster.avif?t=1763022051\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.webm?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.mp4?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Collect, Develop, and Wreck It All!...Or get wrecked by everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ Questionable Companions:</strong> Welcome to Ward 308... I mean, 308 fellow travelers. Admitted guests include: A broccoli with an inferiority complex about its butt-shaped head, a zombie philosopher pondering existence with his skeletal frame, and a goblin craftsman who firmly denies his potions are stolen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ &quot;Permanently Deletable&quot; NPCs:</strong> Yeah, we're padding the list again. But doesn't it feel good to personally delete a bug from the world?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Bosses with Their Own Anthems:</strong> Get pumped! Face mighty bosses that tolerate no nonsense, baptized in rock and heavy metal. Your strategy, not your stats, will be tested.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.poster.avif?t=1763022051\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.webm?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.mp4?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1000+ Mind-Boggling Gear Pieces:</strong> Gear is everything! What ridiculous builds can you come up with? We're curious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Character Cards for Team Synergy:</strong> Collect them to grant permanent buffs to your whole team. Power-leveling? No cap, just grind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ Addictive Tracks for Your Playlist:</strong> Turn that haunted &quot;Greenhouse Disco&quot; into your personal DJ booth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/00f5255f6fec5cf58acf36155dde6e0b.poster.avif?t=1763022051\" width=912 height=786 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/00f5255f6fec5cf58acf36155dde6e0b.webm?t=1763022051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Now, hit [Start Game] and\u2014Good Luck. You're gonna need it.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157170?t=1763022051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157170?t=1763022051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/13b660f81031df9f759231c120c12c11605969f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763022051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/13b660f81031df9f759231c120c12c11605969f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763022051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3945740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb